{"id":"n48896-1-10","stage":1,"title":"독서 · 读书","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48896-1-10-1","ko":"지수 씨, 새해 계획은 세웠어요?","zh":"智秀，你定新年计划了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀","readings":[{"term":"지수","audio":"/audio/0d32317250d77806a4f2.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"씨,","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새해","meaning":"新年","explanation":"새해：新年","readings":[{"term":"새해","audio":"/audio/9131dc433c64dfce6c01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67897","senseId":"1","lemma":"새해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계획은","meaning":"计划，筹划","explanation":"계획：计划，筹划；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"계획","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23324","senseId":"1","lemma":"계획","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"세웠어요?","meaning":"制定，决定","explanation":"세우다：制定，决定；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"세우다","audio":"/audio/23575e84cdfb112c017e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58163","senseId":"4","lemma":"세우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"9131dc433c64dfce","term":"새해","zh":"新年","audio":"/audio/9131dc433c64dfce6c01.mp3","entryId":"67897","definition":"新开始的一年。","pronunciation":["새해"]},{"id":"b0fe4ea3ac5ac402","term":"계획","zh":"计划，筹划","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3","entryId":"23324","definition":"仔细考虑并决定将来的事情。","pronunciation":["계ː획","게ː훽"]},{"id":"23575e84cdfb112c","term":"세우다","zh":"制定，决定","audio":"/audio/23575e84cdfb112c017e.mp3","entryId":"58163","definition":"确定计划或决心。","pronunciation":["세우다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1c1782e9c58df18bd49b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n48896-1-10-2","ko":"네. 저는 올해에는 꼭 일주일에 한 권씩 독서를 하기로 결심했어요.","zh":"定了。我决定今年每周一定要读一本书。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올해에는","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"一定，必定","explanation":"꼭：一定，必定","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일주일에","meaning":"一周，一星期","explanation":"일주일：一周，一星期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"일주일","audio":"/audio/d7137afeb52708a5fcb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30189","senseId":"1","lemma":"일주일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一个，同一","explanation":"한：一个，同一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"4","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"권씩","meaning":"本","explanation":"권：本；씩：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"권","audio":"/audio/5e113c9ef13b571371a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62537","senseId":"1","lemma":"권","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"독서를","meaning":"读书","explanation":"독서：读书；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"독서","audio":"/audio/65842003806ebef2a058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"ent